  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/pJmCFF0p/e89faefc522d601db2a5fd70136f37ef7ce18569.png\" alt=\"手工艺品\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\">\n<p style=\"display:inline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/resourceful-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/r/jUWHY2.svg?compress=false\" alt=\"需要 Resourceful Lib\" width=\"202\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/r/I80VLV.svg?compress=false\" alt=\"Terrarium 製作\" width=\"155\" height=\"56\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"display:inline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fhandcrafted\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" height=\"56\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"display:inline\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"display:inline\">&nbsp;</p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">📖關於本模組 📖</h3>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:center\">來自 Chipped 的創作者，我們現在推出了 Handcrafted！一款讓你的房屋變成溫馨家園的模組！:D 你在尋找奇幻、蒸氣龐克或中世紀風格嗎？還是你更傾向於原版裝飾？不用再找了！我們創作了超過 250 件家具供你選擇。無論是椅子、桌子、長凳還是書桌，我們全都整齊地打包在單一模組中。這個模組將提供你所有需要的家具，讓你的方塊房屋變成真正的家！</p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<h4>程式設計師：</h4>\nAlex Nijjar, CodexAdrian, MsRandom, ThatGravyBoat\n<h4>美術設計：</h4>\nKekie6, Facu, Marc-IceBlade</div>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\">\n<h3>✨社群連結✨<br><br></h3>\n<p style=\"display:inline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutube.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Youtube\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/terrariumearth\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/twitch-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Twitch\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftwitter.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/twitter-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkofi.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Kofi\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTerrarium\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/terrariumearth/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"display:inline\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"display:inline\">&nbsp;</p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=http://essential.gg/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/514923/description_c1dc4fb6-bae9-4212-a47f-d7a3a4dea600.jpg\" alt=\"與朋友同樂的最佳方式。使用 Essential Mod 一起遊玩\" width=\"837\" height=\"164\"></a></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>